 40\, Cape Canaveral SFS\, FL\, USA\n\nOrbit\nLow Earth Orbit\n\nMission\
 nThe Globalstar global mobile communications network offers global\, dig
 ital real time voice\, data and fax services via its Low Earth Orbit sat
 ellite constellation. The constellation operates in a 1410 km orbit incl
